[Episode 9]</font>

32
00:01:52,350 --> 00:01:54,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What brings you down here today?</font>

33
00:01:54,400 --> 00:01:55,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Don't you usually have us come upstairs?</font>

34
00:01:56,070 --> 00:01:57,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why'd you come down yourself today?</font>

35
00:01:58,000 --> 00:01:59,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">There's something</font>

36
00:01:59,120 --> 00:02:00,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I wanted to tell you in person.</font>

37
00:02:03,680 --> 00:02:04,410
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Come in. We can talk inside.</font>

38
00:02:13,240 --> 00:02:13,850
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What is it?</font>

39
00:02:15,030 --> 00:02:17,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You'll be receiving a woman</font>

40
00:02:17,240 --> 00:02:18,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">who died by suicide after taking pills.</font>

41
00:02:20,080 --> 00:02:21,170
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Her body is in pretty bad shape.</font>

42
00:02:21,710 --> 00:02:22,500
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">So I came down first</font>

43
00:02:22,520 --> 00:02:24,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to brief you on her condition.</font>

44
00:02:25,840 --> 00:02:26,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Before she died,</font>

45
00:02:27,150 --> 00:02:28,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">she came to me for an injury assessment.</font>

46
00:02:29,910 --> 00:02:31,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Her husband had abused her for years.</font>

47
00:02:34,310 --> 00:02:36,170
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He knew the forensic standards for documenting injuries,</font>

48
00:02:36,360 --> 00:02:37,450
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">so he was careful where he hit her.</font>

49
00:02:38,310 --> 00:02:39,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Soft-tissue bruising</font>

50
00:02:39,590 --> 00:02:40,890
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">has to cover</font>

51
00:02:40,910 --> 00:02:42,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">over 6% of the body's surface</font>

52
00:02:42,520 --> 00:02:43,890
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to potentially qualify as a minor injury</font>

53
00:02:44,280 --> 00:02:45,890
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and open a criminal case.</font>

54
00:02:46,520 --> 00:02:47,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">So he was very calculated about it.</font>

55
00:02:51,430 --> 00:02:52,170
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I tried to talk to her.</font>

56
00:02:52,710 --> 00:02:53,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I urged her to file for divorce.</font>

57
00:02:54,470 --> 00:02:55,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But she refused.</font>

58
00:02:57,310 --> 00:02:58,410
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I reported it to my superiors.</font>

59
00:02:59,030 --> 00:03:00,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The police have opened an investigation,</font>

60
00:03:01,000 --> 00:03:02,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">but the victim wouldn't cooperate.</font>

61
00:03:02,800 --> 00:03:04,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The police didn't have many options either.</font>

62
00:03:09,520 --> 00:03:11,540
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">She came to me for injury assessments many times,</font>

63
00:03:11,630 --> 00:03:13,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">but her injuries never met the threshold for minor injury.</font>

64
00:03:13,590 --> 00:03:14,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">They could only be classified as slight injuries.</font>

65
00:03:17,750 --> 00:03:19,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The last time she came to see me, she said</font>

66
00:03:20,360 --> 00:03:21,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">she knew she could hold on</font>

67
00:03:21,280 --> 00:03:23,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">until the day her husband faced justice.</font>

68
00:03:23,800 --> 00:03:24,890
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">At least then, people would see</font>

69
00:03:25,000 --> 00:03:26,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">he wasn't as good as he seemed.</font>

70
00:03:30,430 --> 00:03:31,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But a minor injury is a minor injury.</font>

71
00:03:31,870 --> 00:03:33,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">A slight injury is a slight injury.</font>

72
00:03:40,840 --> 00:03:41,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">When is her memorial service?</font>

73
00:03:42,840 --> 00:03:43,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'd like to pay my respects.</font>

74
00:03:46,400 --> 00:03:48,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But I remember our schedule for the next few days.</font>

75
00:03:49,560 --> 00:03:51,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">There aren't any women scheduled for a memorial service.</font>

76
00:03:52,960 --> 00:03:54,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Her family probably</font>

77
00:03:54,770 --> 00:03:56,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">requested direct cremation.</font>

78
00:04:01,360 --> 00:04:02,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Direct cremation?</font>

79
00:04:07,520 --> 00:04:08,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I understand.</font>

80
00:04:09,710 --> 00:04:10,450
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Thanks, Dandan.</font>

81
00:04:22,070 --> 00:04:22,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Hold on.</font>

82
00:04:23,630 --> 00:04:24,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Wang Can.</font>

83
00:04:24,870 --> 00:04:25,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Go upstairs with Coroner Li.</font>

84
00:04:26,510 --> 00:04:27,850
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Bring Ms. Zhao's body down.</font>

85
00:04:28,120 --> 00:04:28,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Be careful.</font>

86
00:04:28,560 --> 00:04:29,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Handle her gently.</font>

87
00:04:31,270 --> 00:04:31,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Absolutely.</font>

88
00:04:38,100 --> 00:04:42,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[East Lake Sheng's Livestream, Forensic Science Center]</font>

89
00:04:50,040 --> 00:04:52,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Folks, friends,</font>

90
00:04:52,600 --> 00:04:53,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">brothers!</font>

91
00:04:57,680 --> 00:04:59,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Come on, take a look at me!</font>

92
00:04:59,020 --> 00:04:59,910
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Brothers!</font>

93
00:05:01,010 --> 00:05:01,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What's going on here?</font>

94
00:05:03,000 --> 00:05:03,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Look at me!</font>

95
00:05:03,780 --> 00:05:04,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Look at me!</font>

96
00:05:05,720 --> 00:05:06,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Thanks! Thanks for the likes!</font>

97
00:05:06,800 --> 00:05:07,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Thanks!</font>

98
00:05:08,040 --> 00:05:08,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Jiang Shengli.</font>

99
00:05:09,240 --> 00:05:10,370
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He came in for an injury assessment.</font>

100
00:05:11,510 --> 00:05:12,930
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He wants me to change my findings.</font>

101
00:05:13,750 --> 00:05:15,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Change them? To what?</font>

102
00:05:16,240 --> 00:05:17,170
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">His injuries qualify as minor.</font>

103
00:05:17,600 --> 00:05:18,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He wants them downgraded to slight.</font>

104
00:05:19,720 --> 00:05:21,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Slight injuries are handled as a civil matter.</font>

105
00:05:21,680 --> 00:05:23,370
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Then he can negotiate with the person who hit him</font>

106
00:05:23,480 --> 00:05:24,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and demand compensation.</font>

107
00:05:25,160 --> 00:05:26,540
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If the other guy wants to avoid criminal charges,</font>

108
00:05:26,800 --> 00:05:28,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">he'll settle with him privately.</font>

109
00:05:29,120 --> 00:05:30,370
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He was recently</font>

110
00:05:30,870 --> 00:05:32,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">penalized for extortion.</font>

111
00:05:33,510 --> 00:05:34,370
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm Fushan's</font>

112
00:05:34,920 --> 00:05:35,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">East Lake Sheng!</font>

113
00:05:36,680 --> 00:05:38,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm right here. Look!</font>

114
00:05:38,720 --> 00:05:40,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The Forensic Science Center!</font>

115
00:05:40,290 --> 00:05:41,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm here to give them a shout-out.</font>

116
00:05:41,950 --> 00:05:43,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Look at me. Don't I look</font>

117
00:05:43,360 --> 00:05:44,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">radiant,</font>

118
00:05:44,720 --> 00:05:45,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">full of life?</font>

119
00:05:45,830 --> 00:05:47,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">All four limbs intact,</font>

120
00:05:47,040 --> 00:05:47,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and sharp as ever!</font>

121
00:05:47,830 --> 00:05:48,370
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Right?</font>

122
00:05:48,390 --> 00:05:48,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">See?</font>

123
00:05:48,800 --> 00:05:49,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Exactly.</font>

124
00:05:49,310 --> 00:05:50,850
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This perfect specimen right here</font>

125
00:05:50,850 --> 00:05:51,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">is standing here</font>

126
00:05:52,000 --> 00:05:53,170
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">at the Forensic Science Center.</font>

127
00:05:54,600 --> 00:05:56,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">And somehow,</font>

128
00:05:56,160 --> 00:05:58,310
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">they classified my injuries as minor!</font>

129
00:05:58,310 --> 00:05:59,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Absolutely ridiculous!</font>

130
00:06:00,510 --> 00:06:01,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">And the guy who hit me...</font>

131
00:06:01,950 --> 00:06:04,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We could've become friends after that fight,</font>

132
00:06:04,040 --> 00:06:05,370
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">maybe even buddies.</font>

133
00:06:05,720 --> 00:06:07,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But now, with this "minor injury",</font>

134
00:06:07,070 --> 00:06:08,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">the guy who hit me is facing jail time.</font>

135
00:06:08,720 --> 00:06:09,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">And me?</font>

136
00:06:09,680 --> 00:06:10,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I feel terrible about it.</font>

137
00:06:10,920 --> 00:06:11,540
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm suffering.</font>

138
00:06:11,950 --> 00:06:13,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Now, fighting is something I know all about.</font>

139
00:06:13,500 --> 00:06:14,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let me educate you.</font>

140
00:06:14,920 --> 00:06:15,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Here's how it goes,</font>

141
00:06:15,560 --> 00:06:17,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">a month for a club, years for a knife, life for a gun.</font>

142
00:06:17,600 --> 00:06:18,930
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If you use a club,</font>

143
00:06:18,950 --> 00:06:19,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you go inside,</font>

144
00:06:19,800 --> 00:06:21,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">then you're out in a month or so.</font>

145
00:06:21,190 --> 00:06:21,930
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Use a knife,</font>

146
00:06:21,950 --> 00:06:23,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and you're talking years.</font>

147
00:06:23,950 --> 00:06:26,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">A gun? Don't even get me started.</font>

148
00:06:26,850 --> 00:06:27,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But here's the point, the guy who hit me</font>

149
00:06:28,190 --> 00:06:29,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">didn't use any of those things!</font>

150
00:06:30,130 --> 00:06:31,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">And I'm not even hurt!</font>

151
00:06:31,390 --> 00:06:32,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Look how fit I am!</font>

152
00:06:32,870 --> 00:06:33,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Look how alert I am!</font>

153
00:06:33,950 --> 00:06:34,410
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Right?</font>

154
00:06:34,430 --> 00:06:35,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Do I look hurt?</font>

155
00:06:35,270 --> 00:06:36,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Do I look hurt?</font>

156
00:06:36,160 --> 00:06:37,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Tell me, is this a miscarriage of justice or what?!</font>

157
00:06:38,240 --> 00:06:38,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Is this</font>

158
00:06:38,830 --> 00:06:40,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">a miscarriage of justice?!</font>

159
00:06:40,160 --> 00:06:40,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Right?</font>

160
00:06:41,440 --> 00:06:42,370
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">- Am I right? - Jiang Shengli.</font>

161
00:06:43,000 --> 00:06:44,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Was your last punishment not enough for you?</font>

162
00:06:44,830 --> 00:06:45,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Dr. Chen, if you're going to put it that way,</font>

163
00:06:46,000 --> 00:06:46,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">then I'll drop the act.</font>

164
00:06:47,310 --> 00:06:48,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's simple.</font>

165
00:06:48,310 --> 00:06:50,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I've just got a few broken bones. No big deal.</font>

166
00:06:50,120 --> 00:06:51,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But you insist on calling it a minor injury.</font>

167
00:06:51,780 --> 00:06:52,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That's not right.</font>

168
00:06:52,610 --> 00:06:54,190
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You pick fights,</font>

169
00:06:54,190 --> 00:06:55,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">provoke people,</font>

170
00:06:55,680 --> 00:06:56,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">get beaten, get assessed,</font>

171
00:06:56,900 --> 00:06:57,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">then cash in.</font>

172
00:06:57,800 --> 00:06:58,540
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How long are you</font>

173
00:06:58,560 --> 00:06:59,850
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">going to keep this routine up?</font>

174
00:07:00,950 --> 00:07:02,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">When are you retiring?</font>

175
00:07:02,680 --> 00:07:03,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You retire, I retire.</font>

176
00:07:03,870 --> 00:07:04,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm young.</font>

177
00:07:05,160 --> 00:07:06,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I can take a beating. Don't worry about me.</font>

178
00:07:06,680 --> 00:07:08,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What's wrong with giving back to society?</font>

179
00:07:08,760 --> 00:07:09,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You really aren't afraid of dying, are you?</font>

180
00:07:10,120 --> 00:07:11,210
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm helping them blow off steam.</font>

181
00:07:11,210 --> 00:07:11,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Right?</font>

182
00:07:11,950 --> 00:07:12,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Don't you ever feel like</font>

183
00:07:12,830 --> 00:07:14,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">hitting someone at work?</font>

184
00:07:14,820 --> 00:07:16,070
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">People get stressed out.</font>

185
00:07:16,070 --> 00:07:17,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">They pay me, and I let them hit me.</font>

186
00:07:17,120 --> 00:07:18,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">They feel better, I get paid. Win-win.</font>

187
00:07:18,510 --> 00:07:18,850
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What's wrong with that?</font>

188
00:07:18,870 --> 00:07:20,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Can't you just get a normal job?</font>

189
00:07:20,630 --> 00:07:21,410
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No way I'm working a regular job.</font>

190
00:07:21,430 --> 00:07:22,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'd rather die than work a nine-to-five.</font>

191
00:07:22,680 --> 00:07:23,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'd rather get beaten to death by some drunk</font>

192
00:07:23,510 --> 00:07:24,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">than sit in an office</font>

193
00:07:24,680 --> 00:07:25,850
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">getting bullied by a boss. No way.</font>

194
00:07:26,430 --> 00:07:28,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">And I'm not changing the assessment.</font>

195
00:07:28,390 --> 00:07:30,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You have extensive soft-tissue bruising on your back.</font>

196
00:07:30,270 --> 00:07:31,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It covers</font>

197
00:07:31,570 --> 00:07:32,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">over 7% of your body surface.</font>

198
00:07:33,160 --> 00:07:34,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That qualifies as a Grade 2 minor injury.</font>

199
00:07:37,120 --> 00:07:38,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That's a birthmark on my back.</font>

200
00:07:40,040 --> 00:07:40,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Cut me some slack.</font>

201
00:07:41,040 --> 00:07:41,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Come on, help me out.</font>

202
00:07:42,920 --> 00:07:43,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Coroner Li.</font>

203
00:07:44,160 --> 00:07:45,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Should I call the police?</font>

204
00:07:45,040 --> 00:07:46,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We can't let him keep causing trouble here.</font>

205
00:07:46,360 --> 00:07:46,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No, no.</font>

206
00:07:47,600 --> 00:07:48,410
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let's see what happens first.</font>

207
00:07:51,310 --> 00:07:52,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">His parents died when he was very young.</font>

208
00:07:53,600 --> 00:07:55,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">His grandfather raised him.</font>

209
00:07:56,680 --> 00:07:58,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He used to have a regular job,</font>

210
00:07:58,390 --> 00:07:59,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">working as an apprentice at a barbershop.</font>

211
00:08:00,310 --> 00:08:01,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But he thought the work was too exhausting</font>

212
00:08:01,630 --> 00:08:02,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and the pay was too low.</font>

213
00:08:03,000 --> 00:08:04,540
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">So he came up with another scheme.</font>

214
00:08:05,440 --> 00:08:06,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">With makeup and a dress,</font>

215
00:08:06,950 --> 00:08:07,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">he could easily pass for a girl.</font>

216
00:08:08,720 --> 00:08:10,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He'd video chat with men online,</font>

217
00:08:10,360 --> 00:08:11,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">deliberately looking for</font>

218
00:08:11,760 --> 00:08:13,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">guys with bad intentions</font>

219
00:08:13,160 --> 00:08:13,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and arranging to meet them.</font>

220
00:08:14,680 --> 00:08:15,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">When they realized he was a guy,</font>

221
00:08:15,830 --> 00:08:16,910
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">some of them got furious</font>

222
00:08:16,910 --> 00:08:17,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and beat him up.</font>

223
00:08:18,190 --> 00:08:21,190
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He was shaking like a leaf,</font>

224
00:08:21,240 --> 00:08:23,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">scared out of his mind.</font>

225
00:08:23,600 --> 00:08:24,930
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Everyone looked at one another.</font>

226
00:08:25,870 --> 00:08:26,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Old Zhao said,</font>

227
00:08:27,120 --> 00:08:27,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">"What do we do?</font>

228
00:08:28,070 --> 00:08:28,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You go."</font>

229
00:08:32,270 --> 00:08:33,190
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Shengli.</font>

230
00:08:33,190 --> 00:08:35,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Grandpa, you're still awake?</font>

231
00:08:35,140 --> 00:08:36,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You lied to me.</font>

232
00:08:36,270 --> 00:08:37,430
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">-Shengli. -You lied to me again.</font>

233
00:08:37,560 --> 00:08:38,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Shengli.</font>

234
00:08:38,620 --> 00:08:40,170
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why are you only getting back now?</font>

235
00:08:40,320 --> 00:08:41,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I was working.</font>

236
00:08:41,510 --> 00:08:42,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Working?</font>

237
00:08:42,510 --> 00:08:43,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I got paid.</font>

238
00:08:44,270 --> 00:08:45,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You got paid?</font>

239
00:08:45,320 --> 00:08:46,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I did someone's makeup today.</font>

240
00:08:46,720 --> 00:08:47,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I worked on it all day.</font>

241
00:08:47,600 --> 00:08:48,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">They paid me a lot.</font>

242
00:08:48,840 --> 00:08:49,370
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Really?</font>

243
00:08:49,390 --> 00:08:49,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Really.</font>

244
00:08:50,360 --> 00:08:51,650
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Having a job is good, Shengli.</font>

245
00:08:52,030 --> 00:08:53,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">From now on, let's just live an honest life.</font>

246
00:08:54,750 --> 00:08:55,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Later,</font>

247
00:08:55,390 --> 00:08:56,650
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">the investigating officer told me</font>

248
00:08:57,150 --> 00:08:58,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">his grandfather was getting old</font>

249
00:08:58,390 --> 00:08:59,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and wasn't in good health.</font>

250
00:08:59,720 --> 00:09:01,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He suspected his grandson was lying,</font>

251
00:09:02,270 --> 00:09:02,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">but</font>

252
00:09:03,080 --> 00:09:03,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">he never called him out on it.</font>

253
00:09:04,630 --> 00:09:05,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It wasn't until the police came</font>

254
00:09:06,030 --> 00:09:06,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">that he learned the truth.</font>

255
00:09:17,510 --> 00:09:18,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Coroner Li.</font>

256
00:09:20,670 --> 00:09:21,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Hello.</font>

257
00:09:23,200 --> 00:09:23,850
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Hello.</font>

258
00:09:24,720 --> 00:09:25,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm Zhao Xunyan's husband.</font>

259
00:09:26,670 --> 00:09:27,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The one who...</font>

260
00:09:27,510 --> 00:09:28,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">- I know. - Took the pills...</font>

261
00:09:30,670 --> 00:09:31,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">So you're the husband.</font>

262
00:09:32,930 --> 00:09:33,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yes.</font>

263
00:09:34,550 --> 00:09:35,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We finally meet.</font>

264
00:09:39,210 --> 00:09:40,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm really sorry.</font>

265
00:09:40,420 --> 00:09:41,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Before this,</font>

266
00:09:41,790 --> 00:09:43,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">my wife's parents handled everything with you.</font>

267
00:09:44,360 --> 00:09:45,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Sorry for all the trouble.</font>

268
00:09:45,440 --> 00:09:46,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm sorry. I really am.</font>

269
00:09:48,440 --> 00:09:49,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your wife</font>

270
00:09:50,440 --> 00:09:52,650
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">came to see me many times before she died.</font>

271
00:09:54,750 --> 00:09:55,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yes.</font>

272
00:09:57,600 --> 00:09:58,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">She was always</font>

273
00:09:58,960 --> 00:10:00,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">someone who got hurt very easily.</font>

274
00:10:01,550 --> 00:10:02,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Coroner Li, you know, we...</font>

275
00:10:02,910 --> 00:10:04,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We've been together since college.</font>

276
00:10:04,480 --> 00:10:05,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's been over ten years.</font>

277
00:10:06,200 --> 00:10:08,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We understood each other so well.</font>

278
00:10:08,030 --> 00:10:09,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How could she take her own life?</font>

279
00:10:09,440 --> 00:10:11,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What a terrible loss!</font>

280
00:10:15,670 --> 00:10:16,370
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Coroner Li.</font>

281
00:10:19,320 --> 00:10:19,850
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">My wife...</font>

282
00:10:20,540 --> 00:10:22,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's been confirmed</font>

283
00:10:22,670 --> 00:10:24,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">that she died by suicide after taking pills,</font>

284
00:10:25,080 --> 00:10:25,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">right?</font>

285
00:10:27,840 --> 00:10:28,370
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yes.</font>

286
00:10:30,480 --> 00:10:30,890
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Then...</font>

287
00:10:33,840 --> 00:10:34,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Where do I sign</font>

288
00:10:36,840 --> 00:10:39,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">the family confirmation form?</font>

289
00:10:44,840 --> 00:10:45,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Follow me.</font>

290
00:11:01,960 --> 00:11:03,650
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Before she died, her husband had abused her for years.</font>

291
00:11:06,270 --> 00:11:07,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Soft-tissue bruising</font>

292
00:11:07,600 --> 00:11:08,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">has to cover</font>

293
00:11:09,000 --> 00:11:09,890
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">over 6% of the body's surface</font>

294
00:11:10,290 --> 00:11:11,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to potentially qualify as a minor injury</font>

295
00:11:12,550 --> 00:11:14,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and open a criminal case.</font>

296
00:11:15,080 --> 00:11:16,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">So he was very calculated about it.</font>

297
00:11:18,120 --> 00:11:19,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The last time she came to see me,</font>

298
00:11:19,270 --> 00:11:20,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">she said</font>

299
00:11:21,200 --> 00:11:22,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">she knew she could hold on</font>

300
00:11:22,120 --> 00:11:23,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">until the day her husband faced justice.</font>

301
00:11:24,600 --> 00:11:25,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">At least then, people would see</font>

302
00:11:25,840 --> 00:11:27,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">he wasn't as good as he seemed.</font>

303
00:11:30,960 --> 00:11:31,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We both do makeup,</font>

304
00:11:31,960 --> 00:11:32,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">but what you do and what I do</font>

305
00:11:32,720 --> 00:11:34,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">aren't quite the same.</font>

306
00:11:34,480 --> 00:11:35,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">There's definitely a difference.</font>

307
00:11:35,550 --> 00:11:36,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why else would I bring all this stuff?</font>

308
00:11:36,960 --> 00:11:37,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I just...</font>

309
00:11:37,750 --> 00:11:38,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I don't mean anything by it.</font>

310
00:11:38,550 --> 00:11:40,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm just worried our styles might be different.</font>

311
00:11:40,600 --> 00:11:40,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">So...</font>

312
00:11:41,390 --> 00:11:42,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Anyway, don't worry about it.</font>

313
00:11:43,390 --> 00:11:45,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I even think we could work together long-term.</font>

314
00:11:45,200 --> 00:11:46,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You seem pretty trustworthy.</font>

315
00:11:49,370 --> 00:11:50,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Are you brave?</font>

316
00:11:51,790 --> 00:11:52,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Me?</font>

317
00:11:52,960 --> 00:11:54,550
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm fearless.</font>

318
00:11:55,060 --> 00:11:56,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But you have to tell me what this is about,</font>

319
00:11:56,550 --> 00:11:56,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">right?</font>

320
00:11:56,960 --> 00:11:58,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Otherwise, I don't even know why I'm here.</font>

321
00:11:59,750 --> 00:12:00,650
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I have an older sister.</font>

322
00:12:00,880 --> 00:12:02,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's empty up there.</font>

323
00:12:03,550 --> 00:12:04,430
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I mean,</font>

324
00:12:04,430 --> 00:12:04,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">it's really bright.</font>

325
00:12:04,960 --> 00:12:06,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It actually looks a lot like...</font>

326
00:12:06,550 --> 00:12:08,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You know, those fantasy shows</font>

327
00:12:08,270 --> 00:12:09,650
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">where a spirit transforms into a human</font>

328
00:12:09,670 --> 00:12:11,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and has to pass through a portal.</font>

329
00:12:14,320 --> 00:12:15,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's huge.</font>

330
00:12:15,810 --> 00:12:18,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">These are made of different materials.</font>

331
00:12:18,200 --> 00:12:19,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The prices must be different too, right?</font>

332
00:12:20,030 --> 00:12:20,890
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let me see. Let me see.</font>

333
00:12:21,250 --> 00:12:22,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Are these empty,</font>

334
00:12:22,150 --> 00:12:23,850
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">or is someone already inside?</font>

335
00:12:24,340 --> 00:12:25,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This wood here...</font>

336
00:12:32,020 --> 00:12:32,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Hello.</font>

337
00:12:32,750 --> 00:12:33,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Hi.</font>

338
00:12:33,200 --> 00:12:34,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm...</font>

339
00:12:34,550 --> 00:12:35,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Well...</font>

340
00:12:35,940 --> 00:12:36,930
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I...</font>

341
00:12:36,930 --> 00:12:38,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Wang and I</font>

342
00:12:38,320 --> 00:12:39,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">are working together on something.</font>

343
00:12:41,080 --> 00:12:42,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This place is huge.</font>

344
00:12:43,670 --> 00:12:44,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You can't go in there.</font>

345
00:12:48,070 --> 00:12:48,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This...</font>

346
00:12:50,610 --> 00:12:51,370
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No photos are allowed here.</font>

347
00:12:51,390 --> 00:12:51,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No, I'm not taking photos.</font>

348
00:12:51,840 --> 00:12:52,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm just filming you while you work.</font>

349
00:12:52,720 --> 00:12:53,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Show some respect for the deceased.</font>

350
00:12:53,440 --> 00:12:54,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Can you behave yourself?</font>

351
00:12:54,720 --> 00:12:55,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Go find somewhere to sit.</font>

352
00:12:55,910 --> 00:12:56,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Okay, okay.</font>

353
00:12:59,960 --> 00:13:00,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let's talk business.</font>

354
00:13:00,510 --> 00:13:01,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let's talk business.</font>

355
00:13:01,240 --> 00:13:02,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">When it comes to my field,</font>

356
00:13:02,510 --> 00:13:04,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I've got two strengths.</font>

357
00:13:04,030 --> 00:13:05,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">First,</font>

358
00:13:05,440 --> 00:13:06,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm good at makeup.</font>

359
00:13:06,320 --> 00:13:06,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Second...</font>

360
00:13:07,670 --> 00:13:08,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I...</font>

361
00:13:08,030 --> 00:13:09,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm pretty good at taking a beating.</font>

362
00:13:09,320 --> 00:13:10,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">So tell me what you need.</font>

363
00:13:10,080 --> 00:13:10,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Whatever it is.</font>

364
00:13:12,240 --> 00:13:13,030
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No need to get beaten up.</font>

365
00:13:13,240 --> 00:13:14,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You just need to know makeup.</font>

366
00:13:15,150 --> 00:13:16,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let me give you the short version.</font>

367
00:13:17,050 --> 00:13:18,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I have an older sister.</font>

368
00:13:19,080 --> 00:13:21,150
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">She and her husband didn't get along.</font>

369
00:13:21,910 --> 00:13:22,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He was always beating her.</font>

370
00:13:24,790 --> 00:13:25,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Eventually, she couldn't take it anymore.</font>

371
00:13:26,910 --> 00:13:27,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">So she...</font>

372
00:13:28,600 --> 00:13:29,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">She's gone.</font>

373
00:13:29,670 --> 00:13:30,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Where'd she go?</font>

374
00:13:31,960 --> 00:13:32,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">She ended up here.</font>

375
00:13:36,840 --> 00:13:38,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">So we want</font>

376
00:13:39,840 --> 00:13:40,830
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to find someone</font>

377
00:13:41,510 --> 00:13:42,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to scare her husband for us,</font>

378
00:13:43,910 --> 00:13:45,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">see if we can get a confession and evidence,</font>

379
00:13:45,910 --> 00:13:47,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and make him face justice.</font>

380
00:13:50,510 --> 00:13:51,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Then you came to the right guy.</font>

381
00:13:52,910 --> 00:13:53,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I mean,</font>

382
00:13:53,480 --> 00:13:55,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">a guy like that deserves to be taught a lesson!</font>

383
00:13:55,550 --> 00:13:56,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Just hearing you talk about him</font>

384
00:13:56,820 --> 00:13:57,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">already makes me furious!</font>

385
00:13:58,510 --> 00:13:59,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let's do it!</font>

386
00:13:59,550 --> 00:14:00,650
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I brought all my stuff.</font>

387
00:14:00,670 --> 00:14:01,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Really.</font>

388
00:14:02,270 --> 00:14:02,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yeah. So...</font>

389
00:14:03,080 --> 00:14:04,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your...</font>

390
00:14:04,150 --> 00:14:05,850
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Do your coworkers know what we're doing?</font>

391
00:14:06,910 --> 00:14:07,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">They all know.</font>

392
00:14:08,480 --> 00:14:09,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Great.</font>

393
00:14:09,870 --> 00:14:10,650
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That makes things easier.</font>

394
00:14:10,870 --> 00:14:11,650
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let's get started now.</font>

395
00:14:11,670 --> 00:14:12,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No time to waste.</font>

396
00:14:12,750 --> 00:14:13,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What did your sister look like?</font>

397
00:14:13,630 --> 00:14:15,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Got any photos or videos?</font>

398
00:14:15,030 --> 00:14:15,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Anything you have, show me.</font>

399
00:14:15,790 --> 00:14:16,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I need to...</font>

400
00:14:16,150 --> 00:14:16,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll take you to see her.</font>

401
00:15:01,790 --> 00:15:02,370
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Is it difficult?</font>

402
00:15:08,390 --> 00:15:08,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">She...</font>

403
00:15:09,320 --> 00:15:09,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How...</font>

404
00:15:11,480 --> 00:15:12,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How did she die?</font>

405
00:15:15,520 --> 00:15:16,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">She took poison.</font>

406
00:15:21,150 --> 00:15:22,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">She... Took poison?</font>

407
00:15:28,440 --> 00:15:29,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This won't be too hard.</font>

408
00:15:30,750 --> 00:15:31,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Not too hard.</font>

409
00:15:36,790 --> 00:15:37,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I get it.</font>

410
00:15:38,200 --> 00:15:38,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's your first time seeing a body.</font>

411
00:15:39,510 --> 00:15:40,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's normal to be scared.</font>

412
00:15:56,440 --> 00:15:57,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Alright, then.</font>

413
00:15:57,870 --> 00:15:58,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Wait.</font>

414
00:16:01,270 --> 00:16:02,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I have one condition.</font>

415
00:16:05,030 --> 00:16:05,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's...</font>

416
00:16:05,790 --> 00:16:06,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Later,</font>

417
00:16:07,840 --> 00:16:08,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you guys</font>

418
00:16:09,080 --> 00:16:09,850
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">have to follow my lead.</font>

419
00:16:12,810 --> 00:16:13,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm the professional here.</font>

420
00:16:17,720 --> 00:16:18,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Okay.</font>

421
00:16:19,030 --> 00:16:20,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We were already following your lead.</font>

422
00:16:42,030 --> 00:16:43,070
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Ma'am, is that...</font>

423
00:16:43,600 --> 00:16:44,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">An autopsy report</font>

424
00:16:44,910 --> 00:16:45,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">or an injury assessment?</font>

425
00:16:47,790 --> 00:16:48,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">An injury assessment.</font>

426
00:16:48,630 --> 00:16:49,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Are you a family member?</font>

427
00:16:53,440 --> 00:16:54,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm the injured party.</font>

428
00:16:54,750 --> 00:16:55,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Where were you hurt?</font>

429
00:17:10,680 --> 00:17:11,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">So how</font>

430
00:17:11,720 --> 00:17:12,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">did they classify your injuries?</font>

431
00:17:15,680 --> 00:17:16,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Slight injury.</font>

432
00:17:17,200 --> 00:17:17,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I don't agree.</font>

433
00:17:18,350 --> 00:17:19,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I want a review.</font>

434
00:17:19,640 --> 00:17:20,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Figures.</font>

435
00:17:20,720 --> 00:17:22,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">They screw these things up all the time.</font>

436
00:17:22,680 --> 00:17:23,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Look at mine.</font>

437
00:17:23,680 --> 00:17:24,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We're about the same.</font>

438
00:17:25,030 --> 00:17:25,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Look at this.</font>

439
00:17:26,680 --> 00:17:28,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">They insist mine qualifies as a minor injury.</font>

440
00:17:28,270 --> 00:17:29,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I don't think it's that serious.</font>

441
00:17:30,680 --> 00:17:31,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I don't agree either.</font>

442
00:17:33,640 --> 00:17:34,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I just want</font>

443
00:17:35,350 --> 00:17:36,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to settle this as a civil matter.</font>

444
00:17:36,400 --> 00:17:37,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">A little compensation is all I want.</font>

445
00:17:42,590 --> 00:17:43,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yours...</font>

446
00:17:44,680 --> 00:17:45,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Probably a minor injury.</font>

447
00:17:50,790 --> 00:17:52,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's my own fault. I'm bad at dodging.</font>

448
00:17:53,790 --> 00:17:54,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's like this every time.</font>

449
00:17:54,960 --> 00:17:57,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I can never get it just right.</font>

450
00:17:57,350 --> 00:17:59,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Too light, and it won't even count as a slight injury.</font>

451
00:17:59,240 --> 00:18:00,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">And I can't dodge properly either, so...</font>

452
00:18:01,510 --> 00:18:02,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's really frustrating.</font>

453
00:18:02,830 --> 00:18:03,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Really frustrating.</font>

454
00:18:03,440 --> 00:18:05,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I just can't get the balance right.</font>

455
00:18:05,350 --> 00:18:06,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's frustrating.</font>

456
00:18:09,680 --> 00:18:11,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Getting beaten just enough for a slight injury</font>

457
00:18:11,790 --> 00:18:12,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">takes skill.</font>

458
00:18:14,400 --> 00:18:16,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Scalp wounds can't total more than 8 centimeters.</font>

459
00:18:17,590 --> 00:18:18,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Facial scars</font>

460
00:18:18,720 --> 00:18:20,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">can't total more than 6 centimeters.</font>

461
00:18:22,270 --> 00:18:23,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Lose one tooth,</font>

462
00:18:23,960 --> 00:18:25,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and it's a slight injury.</font>

463
00:18:26,550 --> 00:18:27,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Two teeth,</font>

464
00:18:28,680 --> 00:18:29,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and it's a minor injury.</font>

465
00:18:35,920 --> 00:18:36,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Ma'am.</font>

466
00:18:37,550 --> 00:18:39,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What do you do for a living?</font>

467
00:18:40,350 --> 00:18:41,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How do you know all this?</font>

468
00:18:41,440 --> 00:18:42,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Who taught you?</font>

469
00:18:45,110 --> 00:18:46,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The man who hits me</font>

470
00:18:47,960 --> 00:18:48,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">taught me.</font>

471
00:19:12,030 --> 00:19:13,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Xunyan, Xunyan.</font>

472
00:19:13,110 --> 00:19:13,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Forget the rain.</font>

473
00:19:13,790 --> 00:19:15,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Look here. Look, see what this says?</font>

474
00:19:16,830 --> 00:19:17,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Slight injury.</font>

475
00:19:21,310 --> 00:19:22,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I did it!</font>

476
00:19:22,090 --> 00:19:22,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I finally did it!</font>

477
00:19:22,790 --> 00:19:23,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm ready to graduate.</font>

478
00:19:24,680 --> 00:19:25,330
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Xunyan.</font>

479
00:19:25,550 --> 00:19:27,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why didn't I meet you sooner?</font>

480
00:19:27,750 --> 00:19:28,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If you were my real sister...</font>

481
00:19:28,440 --> 00:19:29,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'd wake up laughing.</font>

482
00:19:30,510 --> 00:19:32,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What kind of loser would I be as your big sister?</font>

483
00:19:33,270 --> 00:19:34,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You call this being a loser?</font>

484
00:19:34,550 --> 00:19:35,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Look at this.</font>

485
00:19:36,070 --> 00:19:37,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If you hadn't taught me,</font>

486
00:19:37,030 --> 00:19:37,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">how would I have managed to get this?</font>

487
00:19:38,000 --> 00:19:39,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Look at the word "slight". Right there.</font>

488
00:19:39,200 --> 00:19:39,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">See? That's it.</font>

489
00:20:01,310 --> 00:20:03,410
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's a slight injury every time.</font>

490
00:20:06,640 --> 00:20:07,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He knows exactly how to hit me.</font>

491
00:20:17,850 --> 00:20:18,890
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">See, after you put this on,</font>

492
00:20:18,920 --> 00:20:19,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">once you've applied it,</font>

493
00:20:19,680 --> 00:20:20,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">keep using this.</font>

494
00:20:22,200 --> 00:20:22,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Look.</font>

495
00:20:23,160 --> 00:20:23,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Remember this shade.</font>

496
00:20:24,000 --> 00:20:24,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This shade.</font>

497
00:20:24,480 --> 00:20:24,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Watch.</font>

498
00:20:25,070 --> 00:20:26,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Then around the edges, like this. See?</font>

499
00:20:26,480 --> 00:20:27,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Blend it out like this.</font>

500
00:20:28,000 --> 00:20:28,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Just rub it in.</font>

501
00:20:29,070 --> 00:20:29,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Put on three thick layers.</font>

502
00:20:30,270 --> 00:20:30,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">See?</font>

503
00:20:30,920 --> 00:20:31,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">See?</font>

504
00:20:31,720 --> 00:20:32,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Doesn't that look better?</font>

505
00:20:33,070 --> 00:20:34,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You can't see it now, right?</font>

506
00:20:34,350 --> 00:20:34,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Much better.</font>

507
00:20:35,640 --> 00:20:38,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Then you won't have to cover up so much in the summer.</font>

508
00:20:38,960 --> 00:20:40,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You can't keep making money this way.</font>

509
00:20:41,440 --> 00:20:42,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's not a long-term solution.</font>

510
00:20:43,240 --> 00:20:44,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why worry that far ahead? Forget it.</font>

511
00:20:46,400 --> 00:20:47,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Look at me now.</font>

512
00:20:47,640 --> 00:20:49,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Every time I get a payout,</font>

513
00:20:49,550 --> 00:20:50,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I go home,</font>

514
00:20:50,920 --> 00:20:51,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and every day</font>

515
00:20:51,480 --> 00:20:53,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I lie in bed, order delivery, and relax.</font>

516
00:20:53,550 --> 00:20:54,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I eat whatever I want.</font>

517
00:20:54,720 --> 00:20:55,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No hard work.</font>

518
00:20:55,440 --> 00:20:56,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm free and happy.</font>

519
00:20:56,110 --> 00:20:56,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That's enough for me.</font>

520
00:20:57,070 --> 00:20:57,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Right?</font>

521
00:20:58,240 --> 00:20:59,330
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But what you're doing</font>

522
00:20:59,640 --> 00:21:00,330
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">is illegal.</font>

523
00:21:01,110 --> 00:21:02,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">And it's dangerous.</font>

524
00:21:03,160 --> 00:21:04,330
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I used to be like you.</font>

525
00:21:06,480 --> 00:21:07,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I didn't think that far ahead either.</font>

526
00:21:09,310 --> 00:21:10,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But now,</font>

527
00:21:11,400 --> 00:21:12,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I have no choice.</font>

528
00:21:19,680 --> 00:21:21,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">With this place being like this every day,</font>

529
00:21:22,510 --> 00:21:23,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">don't you think it's full of creepy energy?</font>

530
00:21:26,680 --> 00:21:27,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I just realized.</font>

531
00:21:28,920 --> 00:21:29,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It has to be.</font>

532
00:21:30,790 --> 00:21:32,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Look at Chen and Coroner Li.</font>

533
00:21:32,830 --> 00:21:33,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">They look half-dead every day,</font>

534
00:21:33,840 --> 00:21:34,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">smiling without meaning it.</font>

535
00:21:36,030 --> 00:21:37,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Maybe they've even seen ghosts.</font>

536
00:21:40,830 --> 00:21:42,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If ghosts really do exist</font>

537
00:21:44,510 --> 00:21:45,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">in this world,</font>

538
00:21:48,030 --> 00:21:49,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">that'd be nice.</font>

539
00:23:13,730 --> 00:23:14,870
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Mao, come here.</font>

540
00:23:15,880 --> 00:23:16,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let me borrow your phone.</font>

541
00:23:17,480 --> 00:23:18,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Password is the same as your toilet seat.</font>

542
00:24:19,480 --> 00:24:19,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Xunyan.</font>

543
00:24:21,440 --> 00:24:22,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">My condolences.</font>

544
00:24:22,720 --> 00:24:24,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Please take one last look</font>

545
00:24:24,260 --> 00:24:25,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and confirm the condition of the body.</font>

546
00:24:27,140 --> 00:24:27,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Xunyan...</font>

547
00:24:28,680 --> 00:24:29,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why?</font>

548
00:24:34,110 --> 00:24:36,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This was removed from the deceased,</font>

549
00:24:36,400 --> 00:24:38,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">one silver metal ring.</font>

550
00:24:38,240 --> 00:24:39,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No memorial service.</font>

551
00:24:39,400 --> 00:24:40,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Direct cremation,</font>

552
00:24:40,110 --> 00:24:40,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">correct?</font>

553
00:24:42,160 --> 00:24:43,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">For the coin placed in her mouth</font>

554
00:24:43,400 --> 00:24:43,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">before cremation,</font>

555
00:24:44,350 --> 00:24:45,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">any special requests?</font>

556
00:24:50,400 --> 00:24:50,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No.</font>

557
00:24:51,400 --> 00:24:52,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Is there anything else</font>

558
00:24:52,510 --> 00:24:54,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you'd like placed in the coffin for cremation?</font>

559
00:24:54,640 --> 00:24:55,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No.</font>

560
00:24:56,920 --> 00:24:57,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Our Xunyan</font>

561
00:24:57,790 --> 00:24:58,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">never wanted to trouble anyone.</font>

562
00:24:59,000 --> 00:25:00,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We don't need anything.</font>

563
00:25:01,550 --> 00:25:02,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Right, Xunyan?</font>

564
00:25:02,720 --> 00:25:03,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We don't need anything.</font>

565
00:25:06,000 --> 00:25:06,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Okay.</font>

566
00:25:07,400 --> 00:25:08,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Once you've confirmed everything,</font>

567
00:25:08,920 --> 00:25:09,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll take her</font>

568
00:25:10,240 --> 00:25:10,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to be cremated.</font>

569
00:25:11,790 --> 00:25:12,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Thank you.</font>

570
00:25:17,550 --> 00:25:18,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Xunyan...</font>

571
00:25:21,680 --> 00:25:22,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Xunyan!</font>

572
00:25:30,400 --> 00:25:31,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Xunyan...</font>

573
00:25:32,400 --> 00:25:33,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Easy. Go slow.</font>

574
00:25:37,680 --> 00:25:39,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Please wait here for a moment.</font>

575
00:25:39,070 --> 00:25:39,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">My colleague will be here shortly</font>

576
00:25:39,830 --> 00:25:41,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to take you to the registration room</font>

577
00:25:41,070 --> 00:25:42,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">for the final confirmation and signature.</font>

578
00:25:48,200 --> 00:25:49,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Xunyan!</font>

579
00:25:54,350 --> 00:25:55,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What's going on?</font>

580
00:25:57,310 --> 00:25:58,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm sorry.</font>

581
00:25:58,350 --> 00:25:59,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The voltage may be unstable.</font>

582
00:26:00,070 --> 00:26:00,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Please stay calm.</font>

583
00:26:01,000 --> 00:26:02,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll send someone to fix it right away.</font>

584
00:26:02,400 --> 00:26:03,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Wait! Don't go!</font>

585
00:26:03,160 --> 00:26:05,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You're not leaving me here alone, are you?</font>

586
00:26:06,070 --> 00:26:06,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Hurry! Please!</font>

587
00:26:07,000 --> 00:26:07,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">There are several others in here!</font>

588
00:26:08,000 --> 00:26:08,330
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I...</font>

589
00:26:09,160 --> 00:26:10,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Just hurry!</font>

590
00:26:16,550 --> 00:26:17,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Everyone...</font>

591
00:26:18,030 --> 00:26:19,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It was her. They told me to wait here.</font>

592
00:26:20,350 --> 00:26:20,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm sorry.</font>

593
00:26:21,070 --> 00:26:21,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Sorry to bother you.</font>

594
00:26:21,830 --> 00:26:22,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Sorry. I'm really sorry.</font>

595
00:26:27,200 --> 00:26:28,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What episode are we on?</font>

596
00:26:38,070 --> 00:26:38,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Honey...</font>

597
00:26:41,440 --> 00:26:41,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Who?</font>

598
00:26:44,480 --> 00:26:45,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Who's talking?</font>

599
00:26:46,240 --> 00:26:46,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Honey...</font>

600
00:26:47,400 --> 00:26:48,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Don't you recognize me?</font>

601
00:26:50,550 --> 00:26:52,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Who... Who are you?</font>

602
00:26:52,830 --> 00:26:54,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Don't mess with me like this!</font>

603
00:26:54,310 --> 00:26:55,330
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Who the heck are you?</font>

604
00:26:55,720 --> 00:26:56,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Come out here!</font>

605
00:26:56,640 --> 00:26:56,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Honey.</font>

606
00:26:57,400 --> 00:26:58,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's me.</font>

607
00:26:58,550 --> 00:26:59,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Xunyan.</font>

608
00:26:59,350 --> 00:27:00,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That's a lie!</font>

609
00:27:01,400 --> 00:27:02,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">She's dead!</font>

610
00:27:03,200 --> 00:27:04,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Who are you?</font>

611
00:27:05,880 --> 00:27:06,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I know.</font>

612
00:27:07,110 --> 00:27:08,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You're one of her relatives, aren't you?</font>

613
00:27:08,860 --> 00:27:11,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Who put you up to this to scare me?</font>

614
00:27:11,310 --> 00:27:12,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Besides you,</font>

615
00:27:12,350 --> 00:27:13,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">what family do I have?</font>

616
00:27:14,720 --> 00:27:15,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">There are things</font>

617
00:27:15,750 --> 00:27:17,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">only you and I know.</font>

618
00:27:17,720 --> 00:27:18,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Shut up!</font>

619
00:27:21,440 --> 00:27:22,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Hello? Staff?</font>

620
00:27:23,350 --> 00:27:24,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Where is everyone?</font>

621
00:27:28,590 --> 00:27:29,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Hello?</font>

622
00:27:30,750 --> 00:27:31,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">-Dandan. -Dandan.</font>

623
00:27:32,750 --> 00:27:34,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Where did everyone go?</font>

624
00:27:34,880 --> 00:27:36,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What's going on?</font>

625
00:27:38,240 --> 00:27:38,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Hello?</font>

626
00:27:44,400 --> 00:27:44,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Who's there?</font>

627
00:27:51,750 --> 00:27:52,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Can't see clearly now.</font>

628
00:27:58,270 --> 00:27:59,330
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Can't see anything now.</font>

629
00:28:01,030 --> 00:28:03,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Listen. Turn up the volume.</font>

630
00:28:04,790 --> 00:28:05,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Honey.</font>

631
00:28:05,480 --> 00:28:06,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Look.</font>

632
00:28:06,680 --> 00:28:08,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This three-centimeter scar on my head</font>

633
00:28:08,750 --> 00:28:10,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">is from last winter,</font>

634
00:28:10,310 --> 00:28:12,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">when you yanked my hair.</font>

635
00:28:12,480 --> 00:28:13,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Shut up! Stop talking!</font>

636
00:28:14,240 --> 00:28:15,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">My ring finger</font>

637
00:28:16,200 --> 00:28:18,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">is the one you broke in the spring.</font>

638
00:28:19,400 --> 00:28:20,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">And that summer,</font>

639
00:28:20,660 --> 00:28:22,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">- Shut up! - the injury on my back</font>

640
00:28:22,240 --> 00:28:23,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">still hurts sometimes.</font>

641
00:28:23,680 --> 00:28:24,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll kill you!</font>

642
00:28:25,720 --> 00:28:26,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You spread out the blows</font>

643
00:28:27,350 --> 00:28:28,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">so the injuries wouldn't connect.</font>

644
00:28:29,270 --> 00:28:31,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You still cared about me, didn't you?</font>

645
00:28:31,030 --> 00:28:31,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Come out here, will you?</font>

646
00:28:33,920 --> 00:28:34,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Did you tell him that?</font>

647
00:28:35,110 --> 00:28:35,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No, I didn't.</font>

648
00:28:53,080 --> 00:28:53,990
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Honey.</font>

649
00:28:55,640 --> 00:28:57,210
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The last time I let you hit me,</font>

650
00:28:58,920 --> 00:29:00,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you still held back.</font>

651
00:29:01,510 --> 00:29:03,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You still picked where to hit me.</font>

652
00:29:05,640 --> 00:29:07,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What are you?</font>

653
00:29:07,720 --> 00:29:08,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What are you?!</font>

654
00:29:11,640 --> 00:29:12,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Say it!</font>

655
00:29:12,480 --> 00:29:12,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Say it!</font>

656
00:29:12,980 --> 00:29:13,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This time,</font>

657
00:29:14,270 --> 00:29:15,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">don't hold back.</font>

658
00:29:15,490 --> 00:29:15,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I...</font>

659
00:29:16,480 --> 00:29:18,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I won't get my injuries assessed again.</font>

660
00:29:18,680 --> 00:29:20,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll kill you!</font>

661
00:29:22,110 --> 00:29:22,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No.</font>

662
00:29:22,510 --> 00:29:23,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Go, go!</font>

663
00:29:39,310 --> 00:29:40,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Do you still want to hit me?</font>

664
00:29:43,200 --> 00:29:44,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll beat you to death!</font>

665
00:29:55,680 --> 00:29:56,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Getting beaten just enough for a slight injury</font>

666
00:29:57,830 --> 00:29:58,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">takes skill.</font>

667
00:29:59,440 --> 00:30:00,590
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Scalp wounds can't total</font>

668
00:30:00,590 --> 00:30:02,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">more than 8 centimeters.</font>

669
00:30:02,640 --> 00:30:03,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Facial scars</font>

670
00:30:03,830 --> 00:30:06,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">can't total more than 6 centimeters.</font>

671
00:30:07,880 --> 00:30:09,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Lose one tooth,</font>

672
00:30:09,640 --> 00:30:10,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and it's a slight injury.</font>

673
00:30:12,110 --> 00:30:12,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Two teeth,</font>

674
00:30:14,200 --> 00:30:15,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and it's a minor injury.</font>

675
00:30:18,920 --> 00:30:19,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I did it!</font>

676
00:30:19,510 --> 00:30:20,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I finally did it!</font>

677
00:30:20,200 --> 00:30:21,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm ready to graduate.</font>

678
00:30:22,830 --> 00:30:23,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If you hadn't taught me,</font>

679
00:30:23,750 --> 00:30:24,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">how would I have managed to get this?</font>

680
00:30:24,640 --> 00:30:25,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Look at the word "slight". Right there.</font>

681
00:30:25,400 --> 00:30:26,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">See? That's it.</font>

682
00:30:27,880 --> 00:30:28,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Xunyan.</font>

683
00:30:28,790 --> 00:30:30,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why didn't I meet you sooner?</font>

684
00:30:31,000 --> 00:30:31,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If you were my real sister...</font>

685
00:30:31,680 --> 00:30:32,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'd wake up laughing.</font>

686
00:30:40,920 --> 00:30:41,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Hello, this is 110.</font>

687
00:30:42,200 --> 00:30:44,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">There's a fight going on here.</font>

688
00:30:44,110 --> 00:30:45,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Hey! Stop fighting!</font>

689
00:30:45,640 --> 00:30:46,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Enough!</font>

690
00:30:46,140 --> 00:30:46,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let go of me!</font>

691
00:30:47,240 --> 00:30:48,470
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">- Let go! - Hurry!</font>

692
00:30:48,920 --> 00:30:49,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let go of me!</font>

693
00:30:50,050 --> 00:30:51,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">- I'll kill him! Hurry! - Are you okay?</font>

694
00:30:51,590 --> 00:30:52,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Where are you hurt?</font>

695
00:30:52,400 --> 00:30:53,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll kill him!</font>

696
00:30:53,200 --> 00:30:54,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Can you move?</font>

697
00:30:54,960 --> 00:30:55,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He's a ghost!</font>

698
00:30:55,790 --> 00:30:56,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Come on!</font>

699
00:30:56,270 --> 00:30:57,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The three of us can fight this ghost!</font>

700
00:30:57,240 --> 00:30:58,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I did it.</font>

701
00:30:58,400 --> 00:30:59,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I can't beat him alone!</font>

702
00:31:00,110 --> 00:31:00,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">- I did it. - Ghost!</font>

703
00:31:01,140 --> 00:31:02,690
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">There's a ghost!</font>

704
00:31:02,690 --> 00:31:04,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Get the ghost!</font>

705
00:31:05,920 --> 00:31:06,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Have you ever seen a ghost?</font>

706
00:31:06,880 --> 00:31:07,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You ever seen a ghost?</font>

707
00:31:07,720 --> 00:31:08,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I have!</font>

708
00:31:08,440 --> 00:31:09,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I didn't hit anyone!</font>

709
00:31:09,300 --> 00:31:09,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why arrest me?</font>

710
00:31:10,000 --> 00:31:11,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I was hitting a ghost!</font>

711
00:31:12,550 --> 00:31:13,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It was a ghost I hit!</font>

712
00:31:14,000 --> 00:31:14,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Look!</font>

713
00:31:15,070 --> 00:31:16,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Look! Look!</font>

714
00:31:16,110 --> 00:31:16,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Mortuary Vehicles Only]
I didn't hit anyone!</font>

715
00:31:16,750 --> 00:31:17,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Mortuary Vehicles Only]
Why are you arresting me?</font>

716
00:31:17,640 --> 00:31:18,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I was hitting a ghost!</font>

717
00:31:18,920 --> 00:31:19,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I hit a ghost!</font>

718
00:31:20,000 --> 00:31:21,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It was a ghost! Why are you arresting me?</font>

719
00:31:23,440 --> 00:31:24,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Officer!</font>

720
00:31:54,260 --> 00:31:56,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Every life has its end.</font>

721
00:31:57,480 --> 00:32:00,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Love abounds in this world.</font>

722
00:32:02,110 --> 00:32:03,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Xiaoxian Mortuary Care Department,</font>

723
00:32:03,600 --> 00:32:07,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">may the deceased rest in peace.</font>

724
00:32:09,200 --> 00:32:11,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That concludes our Xiaoxian Mortuary Care Department's</font>

725
00:32:11,310 --> 00:32:13,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">skills showcase for the mortuary team event</font>

726
00:32:13,400 --> 00:32:15,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">at the National Skills Competition.</font>

727
00:32:15,790 --> 00:32:18,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We welcome feedback from our leaders and guests.</font>

728
00:32:18,400 --> 00:32:18,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Thank you.</font>

729
00:32:19,200 --> 00:32:19,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Great!</font>

730
00:32:21,790 --> 00:32:22,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Very elegant.</font>

731
00:32:23,310 --> 00:32:24,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Elegant.</font>

732
00:32:24,960 --> 00:32:26,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">These young people have a bright future.</font>

733
00:32:27,590 --> 00:32:28,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Head Director.</font>

734
00:32:28,920 --> 00:32:29,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Department heads,</font>

735
00:32:30,400 --> 00:32:31,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">take a look.</font>

736
00:32:31,640 --> 00:32:32,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Having a team like this represent</font>

737
00:32:33,070 --> 00:32:34,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">our Qingliangshan</font>

738
00:32:34,480 --> 00:32:36,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">at the Vocational Skills Competition</font>

739
00:32:36,310 --> 00:32:37,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">would make us look pretty good, wouldn't it?</font>

740
00:32:38,110 --> 00:32:38,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Very good.</font>

741
00:32:39,880 --> 00:32:40,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You can tell</font>

742
00:32:40,830 --> 00:32:41,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">they put in the work</font>

743
00:32:42,160 --> 00:32:43,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and gave it real thought.</font>

744
00:32:43,810 --> 00:32:46,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">For this year's National Skills Competition,</font>

745
00:32:46,400 --> 00:32:47,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Qingliangshan</font>

746
00:32:47,640 --> 00:32:49,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">has two departments competing.</font>

747
00:32:49,550 --> 00:32:51,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">One is Director Du's</font>

748
00:32:51,720 --> 00:32:52,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Mortuary Care Department.</font>

749
00:32:52,440 --> 00:32:53,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The other</font>

750
00:32:53,070 --> 00:32:55,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">is led by Team Leader Cao,</font>

751
00:32:55,510 --> 00:32:56,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">the mortuary prep team.</font>

752
00:32:57,110 --> 00:32:57,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Chang'e.</font>

753
00:32:58,160 --> 00:32:58,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What's next?</font>

754
00:32:59,400 --> 00:32:59,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Head Director.</font>

755
00:32:59,830 --> 00:33:01,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Next is the mortuary prep team's entry.</font>

756
00:33:02,070 --> 00:33:03,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let's watch it, then give our feedback.</font>

757
00:33:03,880 --> 00:33:04,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Okay.</font>

758
00:33:04,790 --> 00:33:05,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Team Leader Cao.</font>

759
00:33:10,030 --> 00:33:10,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Head Director.</font>

760
00:33:10,720 --> 00:33:11,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">They're not even here!</font>

761
00:33:12,400 --> 00:33:13,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Does that mean they're withdrawing?</font>

762
00:33:13,790 --> 00:33:15,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No, no. They wouldn't withdraw.</font>

763
00:33:15,270 --> 00:33:15,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Call them.</font>

764
00:33:15,790 --> 00:33:16,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Maybe something urgent came up.</font>

765
00:33:16,640 --> 00:33:18,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">- I'm calling them now. - Right.</font>

766
00:33:18,080 --> 00:33:19,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">- Cao, call them.
- They're on their way.</font>

767
00:33:19,880 --> 00:33:20,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Tell them to come if they can.</font>

768
00:33:21,240 --> 00:33:22,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's about taking part, not winning.</font>

769
00:33:22,480 --> 00:33:23,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No need to get stage fright.</font>

770
00:33:23,640 --> 00:33:24,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Come on, don't say that.</font>

771
00:33:26,200 --> 00:33:28,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Well, since everyone's waiting anyway,</font>

772
00:33:28,790 --> 00:33:29,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">let me say a few words.</font>

773
00:33:30,830 --> 00:33:31,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">My review</font>

774
00:33:32,160 --> 00:33:32,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">is three words...</font>

775
00:33:33,240 --> 00:33:33,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Quite a show.</font>

776
00:33:34,440 --> 00:33:35,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It was like watching a concert.</font>

777
00:33:36,030 --> 00:33:36,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I mean,</font>

778
00:33:36,790 --> 00:33:37,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">lights, sound, effects...</font>

779
00:33:37,880 --> 00:33:38,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">They had it all.</font>

780
00:33:38,790 --> 00:33:40,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But a funeral...</font>

781
00:33:40,640 --> 00:33:42,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The final stage of the deceased's life.</font>

782
00:33:42,480 --> 00:33:44,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We need to make sure it's</font>

783
00:33:46,680 --> 00:33:47,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">as moving as possible.</font>

784
00:33:48,960 --> 00:33:49,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Director Du.</font>

785
00:33:50,590 --> 00:33:51,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Did you</font>

786
00:33:51,510 --> 00:33:53,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">throw those classical lines together?</font>

787
00:33:55,000 --> 00:33:56,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">"Act according to the situation".</font>

788
00:33:56,100 --> 00:33:57,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Act according to the situation]
and "safe underground".</font>

789
00:33:57,480 --> 00:33:58,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Safe underground]
How did these phrases end up here?</font>

790
00:33:59,270 --> 00:34:00,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What's going on?</font>

791
00:34:01,310 --> 00:34:03,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We used big data</font>

792
00:34:03,160 --> 00:34:05,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to find funeral-related phrases.</font>

793
00:34:06,440 --> 00:34:08,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">During the War of Resistance,</font>

794
00:34:08,590 --> 00:34:10,650
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">renowned scholar Chen Yinke</font>

795
00:34:10,670 --> 00:34:12,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">wrote this air-raid couplet.</font>

796
00:34:12,920 --> 00:34:14,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">"Act according to the situation" meant</font>

797
00:34:14,590 --> 00:34:15,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">take action when you spot a plane.</font>

798
00:34:16,320 --> 00:34:17,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">"Safe underground" meant</font>

799
00:34:17,840 --> 00:34:19,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">take shelter underground.</font>

800
00:34:19,840 --> 00:34:21,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But for us, "safe underground" means</font>

801
00:34:21,510 --> 00:34:22,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">laying the deceased to rest.</font>

802
00:34:23,070 --> 00:34:23,690
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You all</font>

803
00:34:24,190 --> 00:34:25,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">need to understand the classics</font>

804
00:34:26,360 --> 00:34:27,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">before you start quoting them.</font>

805
00:34:33,000 --> 00:34:33,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Thank you for the correction.</font>

806
00:34:33,920 --> 00:34:34,650
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Thank you, Director.</font>

807
00:34:35,000 --> 00:34:36,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">They're still too young.</font>

808
00:34:36,960 --> 00:34:38,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Their cultural knowledge is too shallow.</font>

809
00:34:38,880 --> 00:34:40,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll have to give them a serious talking-to.</font>

810
00:34:40,480 --> 00:34:42,170
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We'll fix it right away.</font>

811
00:34:45,070 --> 00:34:45,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What were you thinking?</font>

812
00:34:46,710 --> 00:34:47,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Big data?</font>

813
00:34:47,550 --> 00:34:48,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If I wanted AI,</font>

814
00:34:48,590 --> 00:34:50,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">why would I need you as middlemen?</font>

815
00:34:50,590 --> 00:34:51,210
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Director Du.</font>

816
00:34:51,760 --> 00:34:52,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This whole ceremony</font>

817
00:34:53,110 --> 00:34:53,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">from start to finish</font>

818
00:34:54,110 --> 00:34:55,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">must cost quite a bit, right?</font>

819
00:34:55,280 --> 00:34:56,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">For now, our main focus</font>

820
00:34:56,920 --> 00:34:58,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">is introducing this new approach.</font>

821
00:34:58,400 --> 00:34:59,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We'd like the funeral home</font>

822
00:35:00,000 --> 00:35:02,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to send us to the Skills Competition</font>

823
00:35:02,230 --> 00:35:04,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">so we can recruit more talent.</font>

824
00:35:04,360 --> 00:35:05,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Once we're fully staffed,</font>

825
00:35:05,760 --> 00:35:06,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">our prices</font>

826
00:35:06,360 --> 00:35:07,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">will naturally come down.</font>

827
00:35:07,840 --> 00:35:08,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Can these services</font>

828
00:35:09,320 --> 00:35:10,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">be covered by public funeral subsidies?</font>

829
00:35:12,480 --> 00:35:13,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Well...</font>

830
00:35:14,550 --> 00:35:15,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Actually, no.</font>

831
00:35:15,880 --> 00:35:17,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But to be fair,</font>

832
00:35:17,590 --> 00:35:18,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">people have different spending habits,</font>

833
00:35:19,150 --> 00:35:20,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and families have different needs.</font>

834
00:35:20,630 --> 00:35:21,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We're trying to serve</font>

835
00:35:22,000 --> 00:35:23,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">a specific niche.</font>

836
00:35:23,630 --> 00:35:26,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">So families using public funeral subsidies</font>

837
00:35:26,510 --> 00:35:27,210
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">naturally</font>

838
00:35:27,280 --> 00:35:29,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">wouldn't choose our services anyway.</font>

839
00:35:31,280 --> 00:35:32,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Then I can't really comment on that.</font>

840
00:35:33,550 --> 00:35:35,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But for ordinary folks like us,</font>

841
00:35:35,440 --> 00:35:36,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Most regular folks are probably still at the point where</font>

842
00:35:37,000 --> 00:35:38,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">insurance covers you when you're sick,</font>

843
00:35:38,550 --> 00:35:39,230
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and if treatment doesn't work,</font>

844
00:35:39,360 --> 00:35:40,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">funeral subsidies help with the rest.</font>

845
00:35:41,400 --> 00:35:42,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What you're offering is more like...</font>

846
00:35:43,630 --> 00:35:44,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What was it called again?</font>

847
00:35:45,030 --> 00:35:45,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You told me before.</font>

848
00:35:46,000 --> 00:35:47,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">There are restaurants now</font>

849
00:35:47,510 --> 00:35:49,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">with fancy decor and high prices,</font>

850
00:35:49,360 --> 00:35:50,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">but you still leave hungry.</font>

851
00:35:50,110 --> 00:35:50,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">They're called...</font>

852
00:35:51,070 --> 00:35:51,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Fine-dining restaurants.</font>

853
00:35:52,280 --> 00:35:52,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Right.</font>

854
00:35:53,110 --> 00:35:53,690
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Director Du,</font>

855
00:35:54,030 --> 00:35:55,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you're trying to create</font>

856
00:35:55,440 --> 00:35:57,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">the fine dining of funeral services?</font>

857
00:35:57,840 --> 00:35:59,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If you want to put it that way,</font>

858
00:35:59,880 --> 00:36:00,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I suppose so.</font>

859
00:36:05,480 --> 00:36:06,210
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What's going on?</font>

860
00:36:06,320 --> 00:36:07,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">P-Police sirens.</font>

861
00:36:08,400 --> 00:36:09,170
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What's happening?</font>

862
00:36:11,400 --> 00:36:12,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why is everyone downstairs?</font>

863
00:36:12,070 --> 00:36:12,930
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why is there an ambulance?</font>

864
00:36:12,930 --> 00:36:13,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The police are here too.</font>

865
00:36:14,190 --> 00:36:16,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Officer, please hear me out!</font>

866
00:36:16,440 --> 00:36:17,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I really saw it...</font>

867
00:36:18,360 --> 00:36:19,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Isn't that a ghost?</font>

868
00:36:19,150 --> 00:36:19,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll kick you to death!</font>

869
00:36:19,980 --> 00:36:21,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[POLICE]</font>

870
00:36:28,580 --> 00:36:30,070
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[POLICE]</font>

871
00:36:30,070 --> 00:36:30,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Isn't that the mortuary prep team?</font>

872
00:36:30,840 --> 00:36:31,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">There's even an ambulance.</font>

873
00:36:31,670 --> 00:36:32,210
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Cao!</font>

874
00:36:32,920 --> 00:36:34,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Cao, stop calling!</font>

875
00:36:34,090 --> 00:36:36,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The cops rounded up your whole team!</font>

876
00:36:37,540 --> 00:36:38,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Police Dispatch Center]</font>

877
00:36:38,960 --> 00:36:40,650
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Command Center]
Please state your name.</font>

878
00:36:40,880 --> 00:36:41,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Age and occupation.</font>

879
00:36:42,150 --> 00:36:42,690
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Wang Can.</font>

880
00:36:42,920 --> 00:36:43,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Chen Hexu.</font>

881
00:36:43,880 --> 00:36:45,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">My dad is Song Pengfei.</font>

882
00:36:45,440 --> 00:36:46,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">My mom is Zhao Chang'e.</font>

883
00:36:46,670 --> 00:36:47,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Mao Erzhe.</font>

884
00:36:47,840 --> 00:36:50,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">So you're not very familiar with the others?</font>

885
00:36:50,550 --> 00:36:50,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No.</font>

886
00:36:51,440 --> 00:36:51,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I know them well.</font>

887
00:36:52,440 --> 00:36:52,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Occupation?</font>

888
00:36:53,320 --> 00:36:54,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Qingliangshan Funeral Home.</font>

889
00:36:54,800 --> 00:36:56,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Second Level Embalmer.</font>

890
00:36:56,960 --> 00:36:57,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Intern.</font>

891
00:36:57,960 --> 00:36:59,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What did they say?</font>

892
00:36:59,670 --> 00:37:00,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">They...</font>

893
00:37:00,550 --> 00:37:01,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">My coworkers.</font>

894
00:37:01,550 --> 00:37:03,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You're their supervisor?</font>

895
